
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE]
Reject the Imperial Decree

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE_desc]
All contact with the Empire is being reduced to the bare minimum. Perhaps Canterlot realized this even earlier than we did — but they no longer have any chance to take timely or effective action against us. The independence of the Rock Farm is only a matter of time.

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE_TOOLTIP]
§R The Resistance organization will receive assistance from our volunteer soldiers and establish communication channels §!

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE]
拒绝帝国政令

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE_desc]
与帝国各方面的来往，尤其是贸易来往正被降低至最低，持有的帝国债券和货币正在被抛售或转化为其他资产，就算坐在坎特洛特办公室里的饭桶已意识到了什么，他们也无法对我们的行为做出任何有效的制裁方式。

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_REJECT_THE_IMPERIAL_DECREE_TOOLTIP]
§Y需要我们已不再依赖帝国的贸易市场和渠道§!
